n          $\\therefore \\triangle OAB$为直角三角形\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; right:30px; top:10px;\">\n        <svg width=\"180\" height=\"110\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 110\">\n          <!-- Rectangle -->\n          <rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"160\" height=\"80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cc0000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4,2\"/>\n          <!-- Diagonals -->\n          <line x1=\"10\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#cc0000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"170\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#cc0000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n          <!-- Labels -->\n          <text x=\"5\" y=\"8\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1a6fc4\">A</text>\n          <text x=\"172\" y=\"8\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1a6fc4\">B</text>\n          <text x=\"5\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1a6fc4\">O</text>\n          <text x=\"172\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1a6fc4\">B</text>\n          <!-- Vector labels -->\n          <text x=\"30\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1a6fc4\">$\\overrightarrow{OA}$</text>\n          <text x=\"110\" y=\"55\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1a6fc4\">$\\overrightarrow{OB}$</text>\n          <text x=\"60\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#1a6fc4\">$\\overrightarrow{OA}+\\overrightarrow{OB}$</text>\n          <text x=\"60\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#1a6fc4\">$\\overrightarrow{OA}-\\overrightarrow{OB}$</text>\n          <!-- Arrows on diagonals -->\n          <polygon points=\"170,90 163,85 165,92\" fill=\"#cc0000\"/>\n          <polygon points=\"10,90 17,85 15,92\" fill=\"#cc0000\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr class=\"problem-divider\">\n\n  <!-- Problem 2 -->\n  <div class=\"problem\">\n    <div class=\"question-text\">\n      已知$i$为虚数单位，则$i + i^2 + i^3 + \\cdots + i^{2019}$等于（<span class=\"answer-red\">D</span>）.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"options\">\n      <span>A. $i$</span>\n      <span>B. $1$</span>\n      <span>C. $-i$</span>\n      <span>D. $-1$</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"solution-center\">\n      <div class=\"hw-text hw-blue\">\n        $i + i^2 + i^3 + \\cdots + i^{2019}$<br>\n        $= i + i^2 + i^3 + \\cdots + i^{2016} + i^{2017} + i^{2018} + i^{2019}$<br>\n        <span class=\"highlight-box\">$\\because i^{2017} + i^{2018} + i^{2019} + i^{2016} = 0$</span><br>\n        周期为4，周期内和为0<br>\n        $\\therefore$ 原式 $= i + i^2 + i^3$<br>\n        $= -1$\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr class=\"problem-divider\">\n\n  <!-- Problem 3 -->\n  <div class=\"problem\">\n    <div class=\"question-text\">\n      若复数$z$满足$(3-4i)z = |4+3i|$，则$z$的虚部为（<span class=\"answer-red\">B</span>）.\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"options\">\n      <span>A. $-4$</span>\n      <span>B. $\\dfrac{4}{5}$</span>\n      <span>C. $-4i$</span>\n      <span>D. $-\\dfrac{4}{5}i$</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"solution-center3\">\n      <div class=\"hw-text hw-blue\">\n        $\\because (3-4i)z = |4+3i|$<br>\n        $\\therefore z = \\dfrac{|4+3i|}{3-4i} = \\dfrac{5}{3-4i}$\n        <span class=\"arrow-annotation\"> $\\rightarrow$ 先表示出$z$</span><br>\n        $= \\dfrac{5(3+4i)}{(3-4i)(3+4i)}$\n        <span class=\"arrow-annotation\"> $\\rightarrow$ 分母、分子同乘$3+4i$<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 即共轭复数</span><br>\n        $= \\dfrac{3}{5} + \\dfrac{4}{5}i$<br>\n        <span class=\"bottom-label\">虚部</span><br>\n        $\\therefore z = \\dfrac{3}{5} + \\boxed{\\dfrac{4}{5}}i$，$\\therefore z$的虚部为$\\dfrac{4}{5}$\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
